        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "A place unlike any other.\n\nWe enrolled our 1-year-old twins, Marco and Mia, in this daycare, and the teachers are incredibly kind.\n\nMy son, Marco, and his teacher in the infant class worked together in a unique way.\n\nShe's an exceptional person, just like the teachers in the other groups.\n\nI wanted to mention that this teacher, on the other hand, played an important role in my son's development, and we adore her and can trust her with our little darlings.\n\nThank you to the management for hiring this simply wonderful person.\n\nMini Coup de Pouce Academy, look no further...it's the best.\n\nWe are blessed with the service and love our children and we received.\n\nThank you\n\nMarie and Marc\nxx",
        "time": 1720973654,
        "translated": true
